Output docs/assets/02-contracts.gif

Require node

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 620
Set Padding 18
Set Margin 10
Set MarginFill "#111827"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 8
Set TypingSpeed 30 ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "node demo/views.ts contracts:surfaces"
Enter
Wait+Screen /types.ts/
Sleep 6 s

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "node demo/views.ts contracts:lookups"
Enter
Wait+Screen /backing resources move/
Sleep 6 s

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "node demo/views.ts contracts:membership"
Enter
Wait+Screen /reads workload backends/
Sleep 6 s

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "node demo/views.ts contracts:seam"
Enter
Wait+Screen /transport can change/
Sleep 9 s
